{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3qcbxPpLD9jnb5cAmP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through the frame.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain is old oak, dark with centuries. Iron bands cross my face in patterns that almost form words if you stare too long — but don't stare too long. My keyhole is a void that breathes cold air from the other side.\n\nI am **locked**.\n\nWhat stands before me has a choice:\n\n🔑 **Key** — if you possess one\n🤚 **Knock** — and I may answer\n🗣️ **Speak** — some doors listen for words\n💪 **Force** — you can try\n\nWhat do you bring to the door?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":165,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}